# pnpm-rmux-guard.allowlist -- extra line-content regexes kept per docs/PNPM-RMUX-LAW.md
# One ERE regex per line (matched against the flagged line's content). Comments (#) and
# blank lines are ignored. Keep this in sync with docs/PNPM-RMUX-LAW.md's tables.

# npm -- registry URLs, badges, package name, node_modules, lockfiles, .npmrc
npmjs\.(org|com)
img\.shields\.io/npm/
oh-my-claude-sisyphus
node_modules
package-lock\.json
\.npmrc

# npm -- banned-package-manager guard code (the ban list must contain the literal words)
BANNED_PACKAGE_MANAGERS
\[PNPM ONLY\]

# npm -- caller-repo package-manager detection (OMC inspects arbitrary user projects)
npmCommand
npm root -g
npmIntegrity
pkg:npm/

# tmux -- documented last-resort fallback and multiplexer implementation internals
rmux \(preferred; tmux-compatible\)
cmux
rmux/tmux
rmux and tmux
tmux/rmux
CMUX_SURFACE_ID
tmux-compatible
no tmux-compatible multiplexer
not inside tmux
tmux (install|list-panes|capture-pane|display-message|split-window|new session)
command -v tmux
active tmux session
psmux
Anthropic npm package install path is deprecated

# npm -- generic "npm CLI surface" prose (pre-existing docs, not this concern's sweep)
npm CLI surface
